      "name": "Post-Quantum Questions to Ask Your Vendors",
      "description": "CISA, the Australian Signals Directorate\u2019s Australian Cyber Security Centre (ASD\u2019s ACSC) and the National Security Agency (NSA) released joint guidance and an accompanying quick-reference list to help organizations assess vendor readiness for transitioning to post-quantum cryptography (PQC). To protect their systems and data, organizations must plan for and transition to PQC\u2014which includes algorithms capable of withstanding both classical computing and quantum-enabled threats\u2014before CRQCs become available.",
